{"id":"fermeture","lemma":"fermeture","pos":"noun","rank":2945,"glosses":["closing","fastener"],"ipa":"/fɛʁ.mə.tyʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-fermeture.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-fermeture.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fermetures"},"examples":[{"text":"Ferme la fermeture de ton manteau.","en":"Zip up your coat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1095667","words":[{"g":"to shut","l":"fermer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"coat"}]},{"text":"Nous avons entendu la fermeture de la porte.","en":"We heard the door shut.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to hear","l":"entendre"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"door"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"C'est presque l'heure de fermeture.","en":"It's nearly closing time.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"almost"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"hour, time"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Ma fermeture éclair est coincée.","en":"My zipper is stuck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097820","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null,{"g":"lightning bolt"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"stuck","l":"coincé"}]},{"text":"Cette fermeture éclair ne ferme pas bien.","en":"This zipper doesn't zip smoothly.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null,{"g":"lightning bolt"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to shut","l":"fermer"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"well"}]}]}